# Credential scratch files. `.env*` above does not match a name with no
# leading dot, which is how env.md — holding a live Razorpay key and secret
# in plaintext — was committed. Match those spellings explicitly.
env.md
env.txt
secrets.md
credentials.md
*.env

# Holds real credentials for pasting into the host's dashboard.
